    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Golgaawwan kudhan kanneen quncee talbaa gaarii foʼamee fi kan kirrii bifa cuquliisaa, dhiilgee fi bildiimaa irraa hojjetamaniin dunkaana qulqulluu hojjedhu; golgaawwan sana irrattis ogeessi harka qajeelu tokko kiirubeelii haa hojjetu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Golgaawwan hundinuu wal qixxee haa taʼan; dheerinni tokkoo tokkoo golgaawwanii dhundhuma digdamii saddeeti, balʼinni isaa immoo dhundhuma afur haa taʼu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Golgaawwan shan walitti qabsiisi; golgaawwan hafan shanan kaan illee akkasuma walitti qabsiisi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Golgaawwan walitti qabsiifaman kanneen jalqabaa keessaa handaara isa moggaa irratti huccuu bifa cuquliisaa irraa gurroowwan tolchi; golgaawwan walitti qabsiifaman lammaffaa irrattis akkasuma tolchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gurroowwan shantama golgaa tokko irratti tolchi; gurroowwan shantama immoo golgaawwan walitti qabsiifaman lammaffaa keessaa moggaa isa tokkootti tolchi. Gurroowwan sunis gamaa gamanatti haa tolfaman.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akka dunkaanni qulqulluun sun tokko taʼuufis hokkoowwan warqee shantama tolchiitii golgaawwan sana ittiin walitti qabsiisi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Haguuggii gubbaa dunkaana qulqulluu irra jiru haguuguufis golgaawwan rifeensa reʼootaa kudha tokko hojjedhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Golgaawwan kudha tokkoon sun hundi wal qixxee haa taʼan; dheerinni isaanii dhundhuma soddoma, balʼinni isaanii immoo dhundhuma afur haa taʼu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Golgaawwan shan iddoo tokkotti walitti qabsiisi; golgaawwan jaʼan kaan immoo iddoo tokkotti walitti qabsiisi; golgaa jaʼaffaa sanas fuula dunkaanichaa duraan iddoo lamatti ol dachaasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Golgaawwan gama tokkoon walitti qabsiifaman keessaa handaara isa moggaa irratti gurroowwan shantama tolchi; golgaawwan gama kaan irratti walitti qabsiifaman keessaas handaara isa moggaa irratti gurroowwan shantama tolchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ergasiis qabduuwwan naasii shantama tolchi; qabduuwwan sanas akka inni tokko taʼuuf ittiin walitti qabsiisuuf gurroowwan keessa galchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wanni golgaawwan dunkaanichaa irraa hafe, walakkaan golgaa hafe sanaa dugda dunkaana qulqulluu irraan gad haa rarraʼu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akka dunkaana qulqulluu sana haguuguufis dheerina golgaawwan dunkaanicha irraa hafe keessaa dhundhumni tokko gama tokkoon, dhundhumni tokko immoo gama kaaniin bitaa fi mirgaan dunkaana qulqulluu irraan gad haa rarraʼu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dunkaana sanaafis irra buusaa kaldhee korbeessa hoolaa kan halluu diimaa cuuphame, isa irraan immoo irra buusaa gogaa duugamee hojjedhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Dunkaana qulqulluu sanaafis muka laaftoo irraa tuggeewwan qaqqajeeloo hojjedhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dheerinni tokkoo tokkoo tuggeewwan sanaas dhundhuma kudhan, balʼinni isaa immoo dhundhuma tokkoo fi walakkaa haa taʼu;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tokkoon tokkoon tuggeewwan sanaas akka wal keessa galuu dandaʼuuf mucha lama lama haa qabaatu; tuggeewwan dunkaana qulqulluu sanaa hunda akkasitti tolchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gama kibba dunkaana qulqulluu sanaatiifis tuggeewwan digdama hojjedhu;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tuggeewwan digdamman sana jalatti miilla meetii afurtama jechuunis tuggee tokko jalatti miilla lama gurra isaa lamaaniif, tuggee kaan jalattis miilla lama gurra isaa lamaaniif tolchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gama dunkaana qulqulluu sanaa kaaniifis karaa kaabaatiin tuggeewwan digdama tolchi;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "miilla meetiis afurtama jechuunis tuggee tokko jalatti miilla lama, tuggee kaan jalattis miilla lama tolchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Karaa lixa biiftuutiin, dugda duuba dunkaana qulqulluu sanaatiif tuggee jaʼa tolchi;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "karaa dugda duubaas golee dunkaana qulqulluu sanaatiif utubaa lama tolchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuggeewwan golee kunneen jalaa hamma gubbaatti walitti fayyifamanii bantii irratti qubeelaa tokkoon walitti haa qabsiifaman; tuggeewwan golee lamaaniis akkasuma taʼuu qabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanaafuu tuggeewwan saddeeti kanneen miilla meetii kudha jaʼa qabanitu jira; tokkoon tokkoon tuggee sanaas miilla lama lama qaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Akkasumas muka laaftoo irraa dagaleewwan tolchi; tuggeewwan dunkaana qulqulluu sana irra gama tokkoon jiraniif dagaleewwan shan,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tuggeewwan gama kaaniin jiraniif dagaleewwan shan, shan tuggeewwan dugda duubaan karaa lixa biiftuutiin jiraniif immoo dagaleewwan shan tolchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dagalee walakkaa jiru sana akka inni gidduu tuggeewwaniitiin moggaa tokkoo hamma moggaa kaaniitti fullaʼu godhi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuggeewwan sana irras warqee itti uffisi. Akka dagaleewwan baataniif qubeelaawwan warqee itti tolchi; dagaleewwan sanas akkasuma warqee itti uffisi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Dunkaana qulqulluu kana akkuma karoora tulluu irratti sitti argisiifame sanaatti dhaabi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Kirrii bifa cuquliisaa, dhiilgee, bildiimaa fi quncee talbaa haphii irraa golgaa tulchi; golgaa kana irrattis ogeessi harka qajeelu tokko fakkii kiirubeelii haa tolchu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Golgaa kana hokkoo warqeetiin utubaawwan muka laaftoo kanneen warqeen itti uffifamee miilla meetii afur irra dhadhaabatan afuritti rarraasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Golgaa sana hokkoowwanitti rarraasiitii taabota kakuu seeraa immoo dugda isaa duubaan kaaʼi. Golgaan sunis Iddoo qulqulluu, Iddoo Iddoo Hunda Caalaa Qulqulluu taʼe sana irraa addaan baasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teessoo araaraas Iddoo Iddoo Hunda Caalaa Qulqulluu taʼe sana keessa taabota kakuu seeraa irra kaaʼi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Minjaala sanas golgaadhaan ala, gama kaaba dunkaana qulqulluutiin dhaabi; baattuu ibsaa immoo fuullee minjaala sanaa gama kibba dunkaanichatiin dhaabi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
